On available
    Say "Whew, this is exhausting. Master, we're low on weapons. Go see [Blacksmith] Heppa. Who knows? Maybe he'll give you a nice weapon."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Craftsmen can distinguish high-grade ingredients with a single glance. I discovered something while traversing the Seashore of Hope. With that, I should be able to make you a to-die-for weapon. How about it?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "If you're tempted, bring me Bulture horns and iron bar and I'll make you something fabulous.\n\n[Blacksmith] Heppa will make you 16Lv weaponry for 3 Bulture horns and 5 iron bar."

On in_progress
    Say "Didn't I tell you Bulture horns and iron bar are required for weapons? It's an easy task for me, still I'm charging a fee of 1,000 Noahs."

On ready
    Say "Master, all the materials [Blacksmith] Heppa asked for have been collected. All right, it's time for Weapon Change!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "[Select the weapon you want to be awarded]\nHmm. You brought them. Time to burn my craftsman's passion. \nThere you go. Hope it comes to good use."
